Subject: [PATCH] feat(dspark): add target-exact speculative verification

AI-assisted adaptation over the imported Christopher/vLLM 1107 materialized baseline. The behavior is independently implemented from the public exact-prefix verification semantics used by TensorFold; no TensorFold Zig/CUDA source was copied. This commit is experimental and not an upstream-readiness or authorship claim for the imported baseline.
